{"Title":"An Act authorizing the Massachusetts Department of Transportation to convey a certain parcel of land in the city of Pittsfield","BillNumber":"H4174","DocketNumber":"HD4626","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"TFB1","Name":"Tricia Farley-Bouvier","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/TFB1","ResponseDate":"2023-10-16T09:38:42.647"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"TFB1","Name":"Tricia Farley-Bouvier","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/TFB1","ResponseDate":"2023-10-16T09:38:42.6466667"},{"Id":"PWM0","Name":"Paul W. Mark","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PWM0","ResponseDate":"2023-10-16T09:38:42.82"}],"JointSponsor":{"Id":"PWM0","Name":"Paul W. Mark","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PWM0","ResponseDate":"2023-10-16T09:38:42.647"},"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4174/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Farley-Bouvier of Pittsfield and Senator Mark, a joint petition (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Tricia Farley-Bouvier and Paul W. Mark that the Massachusetts Department of Transportation be authorized to convey a certain parcel of land in the city of Pittsfield to the Diocese of Springfield.  State Administration and Regulatory Oversight.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Notwithstanding section 7E of chapter 81 of the General Laws, or any other general or special law to the contrary, the secretary of the Massachusetts Department of Transportation may, on behalf of the administrator of the division of highways, convey a certain parcel of land in the city of Pittsfield owned by the commonwealth and taken for highway purposes, to the Roman Catholic Bishop of Springfield, a corporation sole, established under Chapter 368 of the Acts of 1898 of the General Court of the Commonwealth of Massachusetts for the purposes of a cemetery.\r\n\tSECTION 2. The parcel of land to be conveyed pursuant to section 1 is described as follows: the property situated in the city of Pittsfield known as “Parcel B”, which is the right-of-way owned by the commonwealth by and through the division of highways, and described in an order of taking dated June 16, 1971, recorded in the Berkshire middle registry of deeds in Book 908, Page 87, containing 28 acres, more or less.\r\n\tSECTION 3. The consideration for the conveyance authorized in this act shall be the full and fair market value of the parcel as determined by the secretary of the Massachusetts Department of Transportation and as agreed by the Roman Catholic Bishop of Springfield.\r\n\tSECTION 4. Notwithstanding any general or special law to the contrary, the Roman Catholic Bishop of Springfield shall be responsible for all of its costs and expenses including, but not limited to, costs associated with any engineering, surveys, appraisals and deed preparation related to the conveyance authorized in this act as such costs may be determined by the secretary of the Massachusetts Department of Transportation.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":"Whereas, The deferred operation of this act would tend to defeat its purpose, which is to provide forthwith a conveyance of land in the city of Pittsfield, therefore it is hereby declared to be an emergency law, necessary for the immediate preservation of the public convenience.\r\n\r\n","RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H33","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H33"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J25","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J25"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable with Amendment","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H34","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H34"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[{"AmendmentNumber":"1","ParentBillNumber":"H4174","Branch":"House","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4174/Branches/House/Amendments/1/"}]}